# Amazing Spider-Man: "Each legendary spell you cast that's one or more colors has web-slinging {G}{W}{U}." Web-slinging names
# no zone (CR 702.188a): it is an alternative cost (CR 118.9) that may be paid wherever a rule or permission lets the spell be
# cast from (CR 601.3), not only from the hand. Bot1 casts two Peter Parkers on turn 1, and the legend rule puts one into the
# graveyard (CR 704.5j). Lurrus of the Dream-Den comes on turn 3 and the kept Peter transforms on turn 5. On turn 7 both
# Spider tokens attack, and in the second main phase the Peter in the graveyard (legendary, white, mana value 2) is cast by
# Lurrus's permission for web-slinging's {G}{W}{U}, returning a tapped Spider token. It enters and makes a Spider.

